### Login
# @name login
POST {{ADMIN_URL}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "{{ADMIN_USERNAME}}",
    "password": "{{ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"
}

### Operators
GET {{ADMIN_URL}}/api/operator/list
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Game integration
# @name integration

GET {{ADMIN_URL}}/api/gameIntegration/get?gameId={{GAME_ID}}&operatorId={{OPERATOR_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json


### Upsert Game integration
POST {{ADMIN_URL}}/api/gameIntegration/upsert?gameId={{GAME_ID}}&operatorId={{OPERATOR_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ../game-integrations/{{OPERATOR_NAME}}/{{GAME_ID}}/game-integration.{{ENV}}.json